      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "稻荷大人会把这些心意全部背负起来，\n继续跑下去的。\n今后也请多多关照。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d24158a11739e699236d16b6d3a0de705ba5d257b7ce400345639bdeecf31b73",
