      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "随着她开朗的举动，腰上护身符也跟着摇晃，\n这道谢方式真潇洒，很有稻荷一的作风！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9635a302fe7ca81c8f729e048dc518d3f6d622e6f05d85c1e556d2b2816b33ad",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
